    "scenesThatPass": [
      "ELLEN: Hey mom. Where are you going?\nEVA: To a party with Sarah and Will so they don’t have to be alone. You want to come?\nELLEN: Why?\nEVA: Because you’re leaving soon and we should hang out.",
      "SARAH: Is that the definition of maturity? Being able to fire your friggin’ maid?\nEVA: Sarah, does this color look good on me?\nSARAH: You look good. Pretty.",
      "EVA: That was abrupt.\nEVA: Wow, I love what you’re wearing. Your dress, and your shoes and your purse.\nMARIANNE: Oh, thanks. Gee, I should bring you everywhere. I love your outfit. So, you’re a masseuse. And you’re good?\nEVA: I am.",
      "EVA: No.\nSARAH: Haven’t we been over this?\nEVA: Yes.",
      "ELLEN: Bye mom!\nEVA: Have a good day honey.\nCHLOE: Bye Eva, thanks for the ride!\nEVA: Oh, you’re welcome Chloe."
    ]
  },
